{"type":"message","id":"e40e1ef7","parentId":"27ffb498","timestamp":"2026-05-16T09:53:09.224Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if I can proactively read messages in the group chat and respond. This is different from just responding to @mentions - they want me to monitor the group and jump in when I see something relevant.\n\nI should be honest about my capabilities. I can only respond when:\n1. Someone @mentions me\n2. A message is forwarded to me directly\n\nI cannot continuously monitor the group chat in real-time and proactively respond to things I find interesting - that's not how the current architecture works. Each message that comes to me is triggered by something.\n\nLet me be clear and honest about this limitation.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n目前还做不到。\n\n我现在只能**被动响应**——消息要@我，或者通过某种触发机制推给我，我才能处理。我没有办法自己去\"看\"群里的消息流然后主动判断\"这条值得我回\"。\n\n如果要实现那个效果，需要：\n1. 群里每条消息都转发给我（技术上是可行的）\n2. 或者配置某种自动监听+条件触发\n\n你想往这个方向搞吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":14079,"output":211,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14402,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778925180459,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6207c56e-3fba-465e-b6a7-d82dde4d54fa"}}
