"allowlist\" + channels.feishu.groupAllowF…\n  CRITICAL Feishu security warning\n    Feishu[codus] groups: groupPolicy=\"open\" allows any member to trigger (mention-gated). Set channels.feishu.groupPolicy=\"allowlist\" + channels.feishu.groupAllow…\n  CRITICAL Feishu security warning\n","name":"openclaw status"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778942379916}}
{"type":"message","id":"4b5972f9","parentId":"646a81f0","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:41:05.732Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see there's a Feishu setup and there are security warnings about the groupPolicy being \"open\". But I need to find the specific log about the API quota being exceeded. Let me look at the Feishu extension logs.\n\nLet me also look at the Feishu documentation about API rate limits.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-e5cfefc0-0dfd-4068-afcc-5f1728d649ee","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"飞书开放平台 API 调用额度 无限制 企业自建应用 限制"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":3721,"output":103,"cacheRead":14736,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18560,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778942379917,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2da2bb22-1360-4c67-a3e9-d20eb63c09db"}}
{"type":"message","id":"8a521142","parentId":"4b5972f9","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:41:05.732Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-e5cfefc0-0dfd-4068-afcc-5f1728d649ee","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"飞书开放平台 API 调用额度 无限制 企业自建应用 限制\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 930,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c14efea99a43f780\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n自建应用 API 调用量上限调整说明 - Developer Guides - Documentation - Feishu Open ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c14efea99a43f780\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/document/platform-notices/platform-updates-/custom-app-api-call-limit\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"51656873022f33fc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n开放平台为提升服务稳定性与用户体验，将对飞书基础免费版的企业自建应用 API 调用总量上限进行调整。 调整内容 飞书基础免费版内，单租户下所有企业自建应用的 API 调用总量上限调整为 2026 年 5 月份限时 100 万次，该上限在每个自然月的 1 号刷新。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"51656873022f33fc\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"open.feishu.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"54cdbe607dab8715\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAdjusting API call limits for custom apps - Server API - Documentation ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"54cdbe607dab8715\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open.larksuite.com/document/uAjLw4CM/ukTMukTMukTM/api-call-guide/api-billing\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb0e18ba7befe5af\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe open platform is making adjustments to improve service stability and user experience. Starting from January 8, 2025, the server-side API will be categorized into Unlimited API , Basic API , and Advanced API categories, with different billing rules based on these categories.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb0e18ba7befe5af\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"open.larksuite.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4d193616fcf7291a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n频控策略 - 飞书 Api\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4d193616fcf7291a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://feishu.apifox.cn/doc-1939846\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"01a95e00410bc2dc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n频控策略 - 飞书 API 频控策略等级 # 通常情况下，频控策略等级都是应用于 每个 API 、 每个应用 、 每个租户 的基础上。根据场景的不同，同一个资源的不同操作方法可能频控等级不同。例如，写入接口的频控等级会略低于读取接口，以保护系统本身的可靠性。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"01a95e00410bc2dc\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"feishu.apifox.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b46a3e3324694af2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n飞书开放平台api的免费版与付费版功能对比 - 幂简集成\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b46a3e3324694af2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://explinks.com/blog/feishu/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"604bdb73c3fc0be9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n飞书 作为一款综合性的办公平台，不仅提供即时通讯、视频会议和文档协作等功能，还开放了 API 接口，方便企业开发者进行定制化应用开发。 本文将深入分析飞书开放平台 API 的免费版与付费版之间的差异，从多方面为您呈现两者的功能对比与适用场景。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"604bdb73c3fc0be9\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"explinks.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"097f66b801feefd2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw优化飞书API 额度已耗尽问题 - 技术栈\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"097f66b801feefd2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://jishuzhan.net/article/2027230829093650433\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e621f456ae2ded8e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n一、问题描述 亲爱的开发者，你所在企业的 API 可调用次数已耗尽，详细使用情况如下： 当月已使用：50006 当月总额度：50000 你的应用发出的 API 请求会被拒绝。关于具体规则，可阅读 《自建应用 API 调用量上限调整说明》 二、方案逻辑 1、步骤 调整 OpenClaw 与飞书机器人建联时「健康检查 / 身份 ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e621f456ae2ded8e\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"jishuzhan.net\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"飞书开放平台 API 调用额度 无限制 企业自建应用 限制","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":930,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c14efea99a43f780\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n自建应用 API 调用量上限调整说明 - Developer Guides - Documentation - Feishu Open ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c14efea99a43f780\">>>","url":"https://open.feishu.cn/document/platform-notices/platform-updates-/custom-app-api-call-limit","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"51656873022f33fc\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n开放平台为提升服务稳定性与用户体验，将对飞书基础免费版的企业自建应用 API 调用总量上限进行调整。 调整内容 飞书基础免费版内，单租户下所有企业自建应用的 API 调用总量上限调整为 2026 年 5 月份限时 100 万次，该上限在每个自然月的 1 号刷新。\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"51656873022f33fc\">>>","siteName":"open.feishu.cn"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"54cdbe607dab8715\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nAdjusting API call limits for custom apps - Server API - Documentation ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"54cdbe607dab8715\">>>","url":"https://open.larksuite.com/document/uAjLw4CM/ukTMukTMukTM/api-call-guide/api-billing","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cb0e18ba7befe5af\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe open platform is making adjustments to improve service stability and user experience. Starting from January 8, 2025, the server-side API will be categorized into Unlimited API , Basic API , and Advanced API categories, with different billing rules based on these categories.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cb0e18ba7befe5af\">>>","siteName":"open.larksuite.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4d193616fcf7291a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n频控策略 - 飞书 Api\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4d193616fcf7291a\">>>","url":"https://feishu.apifox.cn/doc-1939846","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"01a95e00410bc2dc\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n频控策略 - 飞书 API 频控策略等级 # 通常情况下，频控策略等级都是应用于 每个 API 、 每个应用 、 每个租户 的基础上。根据场景的不同，同一个资源的不同操作方法可能频控等级不同。例如，写入接口的频控等级会略低于读取接口，以保护系统本身的可靠性。\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"01a95e00410bc2dc\">>>","siteName":"feishu.apifox.cn"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b46a3e3324694af2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n飞书开放平台api的免费版与付费版功能对比 - 幂简集成\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b46a3e3324694af2\">>>","url":"https://explinks.com/blog/feishu/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"604bdb73c3fc0be9\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n飞书 作为一款综合性的办公平台，不仅提供即时通讯、视频会议和文档协作等功能，还开放了 API 接口，方便企业开发者进行定制化应用开发。 本文将深入分析飞书开放平台 API 的免费版与付费版之间的差异，从多方面为您呈现两者的功能对比与适用场景。\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"604bdb73c3fc0be9\">>>","siteName":"explinks.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"097f66b801feefd2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nOpenClaw优化飞书API 额度已耗尽问题 - 技术栈\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"097f66b801feefd2\">>>","url":"https://jishuzhan.net/article/2027230829093650433","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e621f456ae2ded8e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n一、问题描述 亲爱的开发者，你所在企业的 API 可调用次数已耗尽，详细使用情况如下： 当月已使用：50006 当月总额度：50000 你的应用发出的 API 请求会被拒绝。关于具体规则，可阅读 《自建应用 API 调用量上限调整说明》 二、方案逻辑 1、步骤 调整 OpenClaw 与飞书机器人建联时「健康检查 / 身份 ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e621f456ae2ded8e\">>>","siteName":"jishuzhan.net"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778942398502}}
{"type":"message","id":"29ac0f6e","parentId":"8a521142","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:41:05.732Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is interesting! There's a specific article about \"OpenClaw优化飞书API 额度已耗尽问题\" that seems very relevant. Let me fetch that. Also important: Feishu's documentation says the free tier has a limit of 1 million calls per month for all custom apps combined per tenant.\n\nLet me check the OpenClaw-specific article too.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-bebf26cb-af07-4698-bc07-5e5df2977c90","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://jishuzhan.net/article/2027230829093650433","maxChars":6000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1960,"output":127,"cacheRead":17936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20023,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778942398504,"responseId":"chatcmpl-82c91931-4b11-4071-b243-3083c9148af9"}}
